     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">Dear all,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">our new AHM2 book has officially been published yesterday. Hence, the e-book should be available immediately and the hard-copy as soon it’s delivered (haven’t\r\n seen mine yet).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">Andy, Mike Meredith and I are currently updating our different webpages for the AHM book projects, as well as the R package that comes with it (AHMbook). As part\r\n of these endeavours, we have created a simple, but, we hope, informative, webpage “Hierarchical Modeling in Ecology”:\r\n<a href=\"http://www.hierarchicalmodels.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.hierarchicalmodels.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw222-gDVt-XJyNPMWv0Zp69\"><span style=\"color:black\">www.hierarchicalmodels.com</span></a> (which then redirects to\r\n<a href=\"https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/roylebook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/roylebook/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0cBESxyCkt0Tb_dNRr-Jxd\"><span style=\"color:black\">https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/roylebook/</span></a>). Thanks to Jim Hines for creating and maintaining the page !<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">This serves as a landing page for a cluster of books on this topic and makes available additional useful resources.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">Best regards  --- Marc, Andy and Mike Meredith<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">______________________________________________________________<br>\r\n <br>\r\nMarc Kéry<br>\r\nTel. <a href=\"tel:+41%2041%20462%2097%2093\" value=\"+41414629793\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">++41 41 462 97 93</a><br>\r\n</span><span lang=\"FR-CH\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\">\r\n<br>\r\n</span><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\"><a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw395ujwHXytovoECRisqqkk\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">www.vogelwarte.ch</span></a></span></u><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Swiss Ornithological Institute | Seerose 1 | CH-6204 Sempach | Switzerland<br>\r\n______________________________________________________________<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Willkommen im neuen Besuchszentrum in Sempach!\r\n</span><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\"><a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/besuch/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/besuch/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2J81co_TCKjFNTSUw_n649\"><span lang=\"FR-CH\">http://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/besuch/</span></a></span></u><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\">\r\n</span></u><span lang=\"FR-CH\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><br>\r\nBienvenue au nouveau centre de visite à Sempach! </span><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\"><a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch/fr/visite/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch/fr/visite/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-IbdYwHoCIcWHTzKOjgMi\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.vogelwarte.ch/fr/visite/</span></a></span></u><u><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\">\r\n</span></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">***  NEW BOOK out VERY soon (September 2020)  ***<br>\r\nKéry &amp; Royle (2020): AHM2: Dynamic and advanced models, Academic Press. --- Everything you always wanted to know about spatio-temporal hierarchical models, false-positives, species interactions, spatial models, integrated models, the new SCR/HDS synthesis,\r\n and much, MUCH more ....<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">***  (Other) Hierarchical modeling books   ***<br>\r\n(3) Kéry &amp; Royle (2016): Applied hierarchical modeling in ecology, Academic Press, Volume 1, Prelude and Static Models = AHM1, see\r\n<a href=\"http://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Qk1KOU40KAmLv6i0glXrB\">www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/keryroylebook/</a>\r\n<br>\r\n(2) Kéry &amp; Schaub (2012): Bayesian Population Analysis using WinBUGS, Academic Press; see\r\n<a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch/bpa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch/bpa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zECG_IA6D7LQ-rRrhRugp\">www.vogelwarte.ch/bpa</a> <br>\r\n(1) Kéry (2010): Introduction to WinBUGS for Ecologists, Academic Press; see <a href=\"http://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/kerybook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/kerybook&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eVDPux2bLyz1xT7hvTcj-\">\r\nwww.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/kerybook</a>  <br>\r\n<br>\r\n***   Hierarchical modeling workshops ***<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f=8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f%3D8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2r9_VmZl9z-NEK3mWv45l_\">www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f=8</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n***   Hierarchical modeling Google Group mailing lists   ***<br>\r\n(1) unmarked: for questions specific to the R package unmarked<br>\r\n(2) hmecology: for material covered in Royle &amp; Dorazio (2008), Kéry &amp; Schaub (2012), Kéry &amp; Royle (2016, 2019); see <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum/hmecology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/forum/?hl%3Den%23!forum/hmecology&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494153121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qBS3FJL3qyKNht4I7HOaH\">groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum/hmecology</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
